## Texture (`.ttpf`) & Audio (`ADAT` / AWC) Tools

Focused decoders for RAGE 9 GPU-tiled texture packs (`.ttpf`, `BCPack`, `Gfx10` swizzling), audio containers (`ADAT` / `AWC` Opus and `XMA2` banks), and Bink 2 (`.bk2`) media.

| Project&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; | What it does |
| :--- | :--- |
| **[ttpf-studio](https://github.com/woreksami/ttpf-studio)**&nbsp;<a href="https://github.com/woreksami/ttpf-studio/stargazers"><img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/woreksami/ttpf-studio?style=flat&label=&color=30363d&logo=data%3Aimage%2Fsvg%2Bxml%3Bbase64%2CPHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9Ii0xLjUgLTEuNSAyNyAyNyI%2BPHBhdGggZmlsbD0iI2ZmZiIgZD0iTTEyIDEuNmwzLjIgNi42IDcuMiAxLTUuMiA1LjEgMS4yIDcuMkwxMiAxOC4xbC02LjQgMy40IDEuMi03LjJMMS42IDkuMmw3LjItMXoiLz48L3N2Zz4%3D" alt="GitHub stars" height="24" align="texttop"></a><br><sub>Python (`MIT`) · GUI, cross-platform</sub> | View, export, and replace `.ttpf` textures (BC1-BC7, GPU unswizzling, headerless scan recovery). Also recovers RPF9 files, exports models to OBJ, and plays Bink video. `v1.1` adds a GPU 3D view that assembles whole vehicles with their own paint, rims and tyres. |
